@page "/faqs"

<PageTitle>FAQs | Return to Self Reiki</PageTitle>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-navy">FAQs</span>
        <h1>Common Questions</h1>
        <p>Everything you might be wondering before your first session.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="faq-list">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>What is Reiki?</h3>
                <p>Reiki is a gentle, hands-on (or near-body) energy healing practice that helps calm the nervous system, release tension, and support the body's natural ability to restore balance.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>What happens during a session?</h3>
                <p>You'll relax fully clothed on a treatment table while I use light touch or hands slightly above the body to channel energy. Most people feel warmth, gentle tingling, or deep relaxation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Is Reiki right for me if I'm skeptical?</h3>
                <p>Absolutely. Reiki is a deeply relaxing experience on its own, and you don't need to believe in anything specific for it to be beneficial. Come as you are, curious or not.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>How many sessions will I need?</h3>
                <p>Every person is different. Some feel significant shifts after one session, while others prefer ongoing sessions for deeper, lasting support. We can talk through what feels right for you.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>What should I do to prepare?</h3>
                <p>Wear comfortable clothing, avoid a heavy meal right beforehand, and come with an open mind. There's nothing else you need to do &mdash; just arrive as you are.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Do you offer distance Reiki?</h3>
                <p>Yes. Energy healing isn't limited by physical distance, so I offer remote sessions for clients who aren't local or who simply prefer to receive a session at home.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>What is your cancellation policy?</h3>
                <p>I ask for at least 24 hours' notice to reschedule or cancel a session so that I can offer the time to another client.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section alt" style="text-align:center">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
            <span class="eyebrow">Still Have Questions?</span>
            <h2>I'd Love to Hear From You</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-navy" href="contact">
            Contact Me
